@startuml sequence-diagram
title MileStone - Database Health Check Sequence Diagram

actor User
participant "Browser" as Browser
participant "Express Backend" as Express
participant "Prisma ORM" as Prisma
database "MySQL Database" as MySQL

note over Browser, MySQL
    Implemented Sprint 2 functionality.
    Shows the GET /api/health endpoint.
    Verified against the Express backend.
    This is a technical health check,
    not a Schedule Planner user story.
end note

User -> Browser : Request database health check
Browser -> Express : GET /api/health

activate Express

Express -> Prisma : $queryRaw SELECT 1
activate Prisma
Prisma -> MySQL : Execute SELECT 1
MySQL --> Prisma : Query result
Prisma --> Express: Database connection verified
deactivate Prisma

Express -> Prisma : user.count()
activate Prisma
Prisma -> MySQL : Count User records
MySQL --> Prisma : User count
Prisma --> Express : Count result
deactivate Prisma

alt Database operations succeed
    Express --> Browser : HTTP 200 {status: "ok", userCount}
    Browser --> User : Display health check result
else Database operation fails
    Express --> Browser : HTTP 500 {status: "error", error: "..."}
    Browser --> User : Display error
end

deactivate Express

@enduml